{"4205630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Asteroid Non Clicker", "steam_appid": 4205630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 MAXIMUM PROFIT. LIMITED TIME.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, run-based arcade incremental where every second matters. Position your breaker ring, chain perfect clears, extend the clock, and squeeze maximum profit from a chaotic asteroid field. How far can you push your next run?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏳ Every Second Counts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/83e79aa465e1a3cb31cb6ea3f0a4616f.poster.avif?t=1775681587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/83e79aa465e1a3cb31cb6ea3f0a4616f.webm?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/83e79aa465e1a3cb31cb6ea3f0a4616f.mp4?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is limited by time. Catch time capsules, chain efficient clears, and squeeze maximum profit from the field before the clock hits zero. Beat your best run — then beat it again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛏️ Precision Mining</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/c318adf503a2c96cfef2492d0a9b863d.poster.avif?t=1775681587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/c318adf503a2c96cfef2492d0a9b863d.webm?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/c318adf503a2c96cfef2492d0a9b863d.mp4?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small adjustments make a big difference. Position your breaker ring to overlap dense asteroid clusters and convert multiple targets at once. Efficient placement increases your credits per second — and over the course of a run, those decisions add up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Defend Your Profit Margin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/7da617dbf9e96c8e5a7b04eff2cf3df4.poster.avif?t=1775681587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/7da617dbf9e96c8e5a7b04eff2cf3df4.webm?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/7da617dbf9e96c8e5a7b04eff2cf3df4.mp4?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitor drones harass your ship and siphon credits with every hit. Decide when to break from mining to shut them down, and when to stay focused on high-value clusters. Protect your profit flow without wasting precious time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Turn Chaos Into Opportunity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/c536b0db456a51a4d582f291c96f4309.poster.avif?t=1775681587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/c536b0db456a51a4d582f291c96f4309.webm?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/c536b0db456a51a4d582f291c96f4309.mp4?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy explosive power-ups to reshape the battlefield. Timing and positioning determine whether you merely survive — or dominate the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 Engineer Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/cb8714c83b9ce4dc3327483f13b99859.poster.avif?t=1775681587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/cb8714c83b9ce4dc3327483f13b99859.webm?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/cb8714c83b9ce4dc3327483f13b99859.mp4?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, invest your earnings into a deep skill tree. Expand your ring, amplify pickup value, and craft builds designed to maximize profit per session.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤖 Field Control Through Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/ebe24315271a7d05a1b9884d22158349.poster.avif?t=1775681587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/ebe24315271a7d05a1b9884d22158349.webm?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/ebe24315271a7d05a1b9884d22158349.mp4?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy specialized drones to accelerate your efficiency. Choose the right tools to amplify your strategy and optimize every second of your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 Unlock the Next Frontier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/62057811bb69a126dff9138be0a85610.poster.avif?t=1775681587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/62057811bb69a126dff9138be0a85610.webm?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/62057811bb69a126dff9138be0a85610.mp4?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn enough profit to unlock an advanced mining vessel and launch a brand-new campaign. Each ship introduces unique systems, deeper progression, and new optimization challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📈 Can You Beat Your Best Run?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push further. Optimize smarter. Extract more per second. Every run is a new calculation — and your best profit is still ahead.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 MAXIMUM PROFIT. LIMITED TIME.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, run-based arcade incremental where every second matters. Position your breaker ring, chain perfect clears, extend the clock, and squeeze maximum profit from a chaotic asteroid field. How far can you push your next run?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏳ Every Second Counts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/83e79aa465e1a3cb31cb6ea3f0a4616f.poster.avif?t=1775681587\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205630/extras/83e79aa465e1a3cb31cb6ea3f0a4616f.webm?t=1775681587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.